---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Ethics Code | Men's Post-Divorce Coaching">
    <section class="legal-page">
        <div class="container container-narrow">
            <header class="legal-header">
                <p class="legal-breadcrumb">LEGAL DOCUMENTS</p>
                <h1>Ethics Code</h1>
                <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: February 7, 2026</p>
            </header>

            <div class="legal-content">
                <section>
                    <h2>1. Professional Integrity</h2>
                    <p>At Men's Post-Divorce Coaching (MPDC), we are committed to the highest standards of integrity. Our mission is to help men rebuild their lives with honor and strength. We do not support or encourage behaviors that are deceptive, harmful, or legally questionable.</p>
                </section>

                <section>
                    <h2>2. Client Confidentiality</h2>
                    <p>We respect the privacy of our clients and members. Information shared within our private community or coaching sessions is held in strict confidence, except where disclosure is required by law or to prevent immediate harm to self or others.</p>
                </section>

                <section>
                    <h2>3. Responsibility and Respect</h2>
                    <p>We believe in extreme ownership. Our programs are designed to help men take responsibility for their own lives and futures. We promote respect for others, including ex-spouses and family members, as a foundational element of true strength and leadership.</p>
                </section>

                <section>
                    <h2>4. Transparency in Coaching</h2>
                    <p>We are transparent about our methods and the scope of our services. We do not claim to be medical or legal professionals. If a client's needs exceed the scope of life coaching, we encourage them to seek appropriate professional help.</p>
                </section>

                <section>
                    <h2>5. Continuous Improvement</h2>
                    <p>As a team, we are dedicated to continuous growth and improvement. We regularly update our frameworks and strategies based on new research, feedback, and the evolving needs of the men we serve.</p>
                </section>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>

<style>
    .legal-page {
        padding: 8rem 0;
        background-color: #fff;
        color: #1a1a1a;
        min-height: 100vh;
    }

    .container-narrow {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 2rem;
    }

    .legal-header {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 5rem;
    }

    .legal-breadcrumb {
        color: var(--color-accent);
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    h1 {
        font-size: 3.5rem;
        color: var(--color-bg-primary);
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .last-updated {
        color: #888;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .legal-content h2 {
        color: var(--color-bg-primary);
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        margin-top: 3rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        text-transform: none;
        letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .legal-content p {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
        color: #444;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
</style>
